   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "We've got people to kill. Keep an eye out.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Never thought I'd ever have my own town, but thanks to you, now I do. If you wanna make some caps, head on over to the Correctional Facility.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Just tell them I sent you and you should get in without a problem. Keep a close eye on some of those bastards, though.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Oh, not all Powder Gangers out there are friends of mine - like the group in Primm. They'll be gunning for you no matter what, so keep that in mind.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "My gang's here, but we'll still need a plan before we rush the town. I don't want to embarrass myself and get beat by a bunch of townies.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We ain't got much in the way of supplies, so if you could shake down the old doctor and the store owner for some stuff, we'd be in good shape.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I also thought it might be a good thing to jimmy the lock on the Bighorner pen. The noise from the fight will spook them, get them running wild.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Once you're done with that stuff - or none of it - say the word and we'll make our move.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We ready to move or what?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "What do you want?",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{not in charge of Goodsprings} What do you want now?",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "{running Goodsprings, slightly friendly} How's it going?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
