   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{player helping Ringo} No. I got a funny feeling about you, and there's no way I'm trusting you to watch my back.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "{not outside town} Let me get out of town before we talk. Too many unfriendly ears around.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "What the hell for? Just farmers and ranchers out here. Not much worth stealing.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Didn't you already ask me about this? What the hell for - this place is worthless.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic000",
   "prompt": "What say I help you take over this town?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic001",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "While you're doing that, I'll be here waiting for my friends. Join up with us once you're done.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic001",
   "prompt": "Deal."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic002",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Fuck you, then.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic002",
   "prompt": "Never mind. I need to think about this."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "There are too many places to hide around here. He'd see me coming and then \"bam\", I'm dead.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "He doesn't know you, though. He probably won't shoot right away.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic003",
   "prompt": "You can't find Ringo yourself?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic005",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "All right! We got all sorts of shit in here. Nice job. Better take some for yourself in case you get hit.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic005",
   "prompt": "Here - the spare medical supplies from Doc Mitchell."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic007",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Same old shit that's been going on for years. The NCR and Legion are still fighting over Hoover Dam for some reason.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic007",
   "prompt": "What's been going on in the rest of the wasteland?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic008",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I've run with some tough gangs, but I gotta admit they all got nothing on the Legion. I hear they stick you up on poles and it takes awhile to die.",
     "emotion": "fear",
     "intensity": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "I ain't saying I'm afraid of them or nothing, but I'll be staying out of their way.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic008",
   "prompt": "What do you know about the Legion?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic009",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Yeah.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic009",
   "prompt": "Goodbye."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic010",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{contempt} \"New\" California Republic - nothing new about it. Just a bunch of people with money and power pushing everyone else around.",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 10
    },
    {
     "text": "They've got troops all over the Mojave, but it's a big desert so it's pretty easy to avoid them if you want.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic010",
   "prompt": "Tell me about the NCR."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic011",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{pride} It is now. Me and the rest of the guys busted out of the NCR prison east of here and took over. Now we're calling the shots.",
     "emotion": "happy",
     "intensity": 5
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic011",
   "prompt": "This area is your territory?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic012",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "None of your damn business. You ought to know better than to ask a man that kind of question.",
     "emotion": "anger",
     "intensity": 10
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic012",
   "prompt": "What were you in prison for?"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic013",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] {listing his crimes} Robbed some people, burned some things, killed a few guys.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic013",
   "prompt": "I just need to know if I should watch my step around you.",
   "label": "< Speech 20 >"
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic013_2",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[FAILED] Like I said, mind your own damn business.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic013",
   "prompt": "I was just curious.",
   "label": "< Speech 20 >"
