  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic015",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{realizing player has a good idea} Shit, yeah. Mayor Cobb - I like the sound of that. Running my own town will give me more pull with the guys at the prison, too.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "First things first, though. You go settle things with Ringo and put a bullet between his eyes while I round up my crew and let them in on the plan.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "topic": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSJoeCobbTopic015",
   "prompt": "If you run the town, they'll have to work for you. Food, water, and money will be yours."
  },
  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic016",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "{thoughtful} Having all the food we want ain't a bad idea, actually. Getting sick of eating prison rations.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "First things first, though. You go settle things with Ringo and put a bullet between his eyes while I round up my crew and let them in on the plan.",
