   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic019",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "No shit? I guess the next thing we need to do is hang out and wait for the rest of my gang to show up so we can talk about the plan.",
     "emotion": "surprise",
     "intensity": 10
