  {
   "key": "vfreeformgoodspringsgsjoecobbtopic023",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Good. We'll still need a plan before we rush the town. I don't want to embarrass myself and get beat by a bunch of townies.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "We ain't got much in the way of supplies, so if you could shake down the old doctor and the store owner for some stuff, we'd be in good shape.",
